	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Striking the brain of a creature can be a lethal shot, but in some cases it disorients, disables, or redirects an enemy to lash out at anyone within range. Make a ranged weapon attack which deals damage as normal. On a hit, your target must make an Intelligence save or become [[/condition id=confused]] for up to 1 minute. Your target may make additional saving throws at the end of each of their turns to end this effect.</p>",
